<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>LearningPath — Personalized Learning Strategy</title>

<meta name="description" content="A personalized learning strategy built around your goals, your starting point, and the time you have available.">

<style>

/* =========================================================
   PREMIUM DESIGN SYSTEM
========================================================= */

:root{
  --black:#111310;
  --deep:#171b17;
  --forest:#20382d;
  --forest-2:#294639;
  --cream:#f4f0e7;
  --ivory:#fbfaf6;
  --paper:#ffffff;
  --gold:#c8a96b;
  --gold-light:#e0ca96;
  --sage:#dce4db;
  --text:#1a211d;
  --soft:#59625c;
  --muted:#7a817c;
  --line:#dedfd8;
  --line-dark:#39423c;
  --shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(15,20,16,.10);
}

*{
  margin:0;
  padding:0;
  box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
  scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
  background:var(--cream);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:
    Inter,
    -apple-system,
    BlinkMacSystemFont,
    "Segoe UI",
    sans-serif;
  line-height:1.65;
}

a{
  color:inherit;
  text-decoration:none;
}

.container{
  width:min(1180px,90%);
  margin:auto;
}

/* =========================================================
   NAVIGATION
========================================================= */

.nav{
  background:var(--black);
  color:white;
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
}

.nav-inner{
  min-height:78px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
}

.logo{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:11px;
  font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:-.04em;
}

.logo-mark{
  width:31px;
  height:31px;
  border:1px solid var(--gold);
  display:grid;
  place-items:center;
  position:relative;
}

.logo-mark:before{
  content:"";
  width:10px;
  height:10px;
  border:1px solid var(--gold-light);
  transform:rotate(45deg);
}

.logo-name{
  font-size:1.02rem;
}

.logo-name span{
  color:var(--gold-light);
}

.nav-right{
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:30px;
}

.nav-right a{
  color:#c3c9c4;
  font-size:.82rem;
  font-weight:600;
}

.nav-button{
  padding:10px 17px;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);
  color:white!important;
  transition:.2s ease;
}

.nav-button:hover{
  border-color:var(--gold);
  color:var(--gold-light)!important;
}

/* =========================================================
   HERO
========================================================= */

.hero{
  background:var(--black);
  color:white;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  padding:105px 0 115px;
}

.hero:after{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  width:550px;
  height:550px;
  border:1px solid rgba(200,169,107,.12);
  border-radius:50%;
  right:-230px;
  top:-210px;
}

.hero-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;
  gap:85px;
  align-items:center;
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
}

.hero-eyebrow{
  color:var(--gold-light);
  font-size:.72rem;
  font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:.18em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  margin-bottom:27px;
}

.hero h1{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-size:clamp(3.5rem,6vw,6.3rem);
  line-height:.96;
  font-weight:400;
  letter-spacing:-.065em;
  max-width:780px;
}

.hero h1 em{
  color:var(--gold-light);
  font-style:normal;
}

.hero-description{
  max-width:640px;
  color:#bfc7c1;
  font-size:1.08rem;
  margin-top:29px;
}

.hero-actions{
  display:flex;
  gap:13px;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:36px;
}

.button{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  padding:15px 23px;
  font-size:.84rem;
  font-weight:800;
  letter-spacing:.01em;
  transition:.2s ease;
}

.button-gold{
  background:var(--gold);
  color:#141712;
}

.button-gold:hover{
  background:var(--gold-light);
  transform:translateY(-2px);
}

.button-outline{
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.23);
  color:white;
}

.button-outline:hover{
  border-color:var(--gold);
}

.hero-small{
  margin-top:18px;
  color:#7f8b84;
  font-size:.75rem;
}

/* =========================================================
   HERO VISUAL
========================================================= */

.strategy-card{
  background:#1a201b;
  border:1px solid #333c35;
  padding:31px;
  box-shadow:0 35px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.28);
}

.strategy-top{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  padding-bottom:21px;
  border-bottom:1px solid #343c36;
}

.strategy-label{
  color:#89948c;
  font-size:.65rem;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:.15em;
  font-weight:800;
}

.strategy-status{
  font-size:.65rem;
  color:var(--gold-light);
  border:1px solid #64553a;
  padding:5px 8px;
}

.strategy-title{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-size:1.65rem;
  font-weight:400;
  margin:25px 0 27px;
}

.strategy-row{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;
  gap:15px;
  padding:17px 0;
  border-top:1px solid #303832;
}

.strategy-number{
  color:var(--gold);
  font-size:.72rem;
  font-weight:800;
  padding-top:2px;
}

.strategy-row strong{
  display:block;
  font-size:.88rem;
  font-weight:700;
}

.strategy-row p{
  color:#87918a;
  font-size:.76rem;
  margin-top:3px;
}

/* =========================================================
   INTRO
========================================================= */

.intro{
  background:var(--ivory);
  padding:115px 0;
}

.intro-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:.75fr 1.25fr;
  gap:100px;
}

.overline{
  color:var(--forest);
  font-size:.7rem;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:.17em;
  font-weight:900;
  margin-bottom:17px;
}

.intro h2{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4vw,4rem);
  font-weight:400;
  line-height:1.04;
  letter-spacing:-.045em;
}

.intro-copy{
  font-size:1.05rem;
  color:var(--soft);
  max-width:650px;
}

.intro-copy p + p{
  margin-top:20px;
}

.intro-highlight{
  margin-top:28px;
  padding-left:19px;
  border-left:2px solid var(--gold);
  color:var(--text);
  font-weight:700;
}

/* =========================================================
   PROBLEM
========================================================= */

.problem{
  background:var(--forest);
  color:white;
  padding:105px 0;
}

.problem-header{
  max-width:720px;
  margin-bottom:55px;
}

.problem .overline{
  color:var(--gold-light);
}

.problem h2{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4.1rem);
  line-height:1;
  letter-spacing:-.05em;
}

.problem-intro{
  color:#bac8bf;
  margin-top:19px;
  max-width:620px;
}

.problem-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
  border-top:1px solid var(--line-dark);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-dark);
}

.problem-item{
  padding:34px 30px 38px;
  border-right:1px solid var(--line-dark);
}

.problem-item:last-child{
  border-right:none;
}

.problem-number{
  color:var(--gold);
  font-size:.67rem;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:.15em;
}

.problem-item h3{
  font-size:1.05rem;
  margin:20px 0 9px;
}

.problem-item p{
  color:#aebbb2;
  font-size:.86rem;
}

/* =========================================================
   TRANSFORMATION
========================================================= */

.transformation{
  padding:110px 0;
  background:var(--cream);
}

.transformation-header{
  max-width:700px;
  margin-bottom:50px;
}

.transformation h2{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem);
  line-height:1;
  letter-spacing:-.05em;
}

.transformation-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:1px;
  background:var(--line);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
}

.transform-box{
  background:var(--ivory);
  padding:42px;
}

.transform-box:last-child{
  background:var(--forest);
  color:white;
}

.transform-label{
  font-size:.67rem;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:.15em;
  font-weight:900;
  margin-bottom:25px;
}

.transform-box:first-child .transform-label{
  color:var(--muted);
}

.transform-box:last-child .transform-label{
  color:var(--gold-light);
}

.transform-list{
  list-style:none;
}

.transform-list li{
  padding:13px 0;
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  font-size:.9rem;
}

.transform-box:last-child li{
  border-color:var(--line-dark);
}

.transform-list li:before{
  content:"";
  display:inline-block;
  width:6px;
  height:6px;
  border-radius:50%;
  margin:0 11px 2px 0;
  background:var(--gold);
}

/* =========================================================
   OFFER
========================================================= */

.offer{
  background:var(--ivory);
  padding:120px 0;
}

.offer-header{
  text-align:center;
  max-width:720px;
  margin:0 auto 55px;
}

.offer-header h2{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-size:clamp(2.7rem,4vw,4.2rem);
  font-weight:400;
  line-height:1;
  letter-spacing:-.05em;
}

.offer-header p{
  color:var(--soft);
  margin-top:18px;
}

.offer-card{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.offer-content{
  background:white;
  padding:52px;
}

.offer-content h3{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-size:2rem;
  font-weight:400;
  margin-bottom:13px;
}

.offer-content > p{
  color:var(--soft);
  max-width:620px;
}

.feature-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:1px;
  background:var(--line);
  margin-top:35px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
}

.feature{
  background:#fbfbf8;
  padding:19px;
  font-size:.84rem;
  font-weight:700;
}

.feature span{
  display:block;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.73rem;
  font-weight:500;
  margin-top:3px;
}

.offer-price{
  background:var(--forest);
  color:white;
  padding:52px 42px;
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  justify-content:center;
}

.price-overline{
  color:var(--gold-light);
  font-size:.68rem;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  letter-spacing:.16em;
  font-weight:900;
}

.price{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-size:5rem;
  line-height:1;
  margin:12px 0 5px;
  font-weight:400;
}

.price-description{
  color:#aebbb3;
  font-size:.8rem;
}

.price-details{
  list-style:none;
  margin:30px 0;
}

.price-details li{
  padding:10px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-dark);
  color:#d0d8d2;
  font-size:.82rem;
}

.price-button{
  background:var(--gold);
  color:#151813;
  text-align:center;
  padding:15px;
  font-size:.82rem;
  font-weight:900;
  transition:.2s ease;
}

.price-button:hover{
  background:var(--gold-light);
}

/* =========================================================
   PROCESS
========================================================= */

.process{
  background:white;
  padding:110px 0;
}

.process-header{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:50px;
  align-items:end;
  margin-bottom:50px;
}

.process-header h2{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem);
  line-height:1;
  letter-spacing:-.05em;
}

.process-header p{
  max-width:420px;
  color:var(--soft);
}

.process-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
  border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}

.process-item{
  padding:34px 25px 38px;
  border-right:1px solid var(--line);
}

.process-item:last-child{
  border-right:none;
}

.process-number{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  color:var(--gold);
  font-size:1.7rem;
}

.process-item h3{
  font-size:1rem;
  margin:17px 0 9px;
}

.process-item p{
  color:var(--muted);
  font-size:.82rem;
}

/* =========================================================
   OBJECTIONS
========================================================= */

.objections{
  background:#ebe9e1;
  padding:110px 0;
}

.objection-layout{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;
  gap:100px;
}

.objections h2{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-weight:400;
  font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem);
  line-height:1;
  letter-spacing:-.05em;
}

.questions{
  border-top:1px solid #cfd0c9;
}

.question{
  padding:24px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid #cfd0c9;
}

.question h3{
  font-size:.96rem;
  margin-bottom:7px;
}

.question p{
  color:var(--soft);
  font-size:.83rem;
  max-width:700px;
}

/* =========================================================
   FINAL CTA
========================================================= */

.final{
  background:var(--black);
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
  padding:125px 0;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}

.final:before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  width:700px;
  height:700px;
  border:1px solid rgba(200,169,107,.09);
  border-radius:50%;
  left:50%;
  top:50%;
  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
}

.final-content{
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
}

.final .overline{
  color:var(--gold-light);
}

.final h2{
  font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
  font-size:clamp(3rem,5vw,5rem);
  font-weight:400;
  line-height:.98;
  letter-spacing:-.06em;
  max-width:820px;
  margin:auto;
}

.final p{
  color:#aeb7b1;
  max-width:570px;
  margin:23px auto 31px;
}

.final .button{
  background:var(--gold);
  color:#111310;
}

.final-note{
  margin-top:16px;
  color:#6f7872!important;
  font-size:.72rem!important;
}

/* =========================================================
   FOOTER
========================================================= */

footer{
  background:#0b0d0b;
  color:#68716b;
  padding:27px 0;
  font-size:.7rem;
}

.footer-inner{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:20px;
}

/* =========================================================
   RESPONSIVE
========================================================= */

@media(max-width:900px){

  .hero-grid,
  .intro-grid,
  .offer-card,
  .objection-layout{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .hero-grid{
    gap:55px;
  }

  .intro-grid{
    gap:45px;
  }

  .problem-grid{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .problem-item{
    border-right:none;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-dark);
  }

  .problem-item:last-child{
    border-bottom:none;
  }

  .process-grid{
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  }

  .process-item:nth-child(2){
    border-right:none;
  }

  .process-item:nth-child(-n+2){
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .objection-layout{
    gap:45px;
  }

  .nav-right a:not(.nav-button){
    display:none;
  }
}

@media(max-width:600px){

  .container{
    width:88%;
  }

  .hero{
    padding:75px 0 80px;
  }

  .hero h1{
    font-size:3.35rem;
  }

  .hero-actions{
    flex-direction:column;
  }

  .hero-actions .button{
    width:100%;
  }

  .intro,
  .problem,
  .transformation,
  .offer,
  .process,
  .objections{
    padding:75px 0;
  }

  .transformation-grid{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .offer-content,
  .offer-price{
    padding:32px;
  }

  .feature-grid{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .process-grid{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .process-item{
    border-right:none;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .process-item:last-child{
    border-bottom:none;
  }

  .process-header{
    display:block;
  }

  .process-header p{
    margin-top:18px;
  }

  .footer-inner{
    flex-direction:column;
  }
}

</style>
</head>


<body>


<!-- =====================================================
     NAVIGATION
===================================================== -->

<nav class="nav">

  <div class="container nav-inner">

    <a href="#" class="logo">

      <div class="logo-mark"></div>

      <div class="logo-name">
        Learning<span>Path</span>
      </div>

    </a>

    <div class="nav-right">

      <a href="#process">How It Works</a>

      <a href="#offer">The Service</a>

      <a href="#questions">Questions</a>

      <a href="#start" class="nav-button">
        Get Started
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</nav>


<!-- =====================================================
     HERO
===================================================== -->

<header class="hero">

  <div class="container hero-grid">

    <div>

      <div class="hero-eyebrow">
        Personalized learning strategy
      </div>

      <h1>
        Learn with
        <em>direction.</em>
      </h1>

      <p class="hero-description">
        The internet gives you more information than you'll ever need.
        We turn that information into a focused learning path built
        around what you're trying to accomplish.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-actions">

        <a href="#start" class="button button-gold">
          Build My Learning Roadmap
        </a>

        <a href="#offer" class="button button-outline">
          Explore the Service
        </a>

      </div>

      <div class="hero-small">
        Research · Structure · Practice · Evidence
      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="strategy-card">

      <div class="strategy-top">

        <div class="strategy-label">
          Personalized strategy
        </div>

        <div class="strategy-status">
          CUSTOM BUILT
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="strategy-title">
        From learning goal<br>
        to practical path.
      </div>

      <div class="strategy-row">

        <div class="strategy-number">
          01
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Define the destination</strong>
          <p>Identify the outcome you're working toward.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="strategy-row">

        <div class="strategy-number">
          02
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Research the route</strong>
          <p>Filter resources and identify the useful ones.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="strategy-row">

        <div class="strategy-number">
          03
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Sequence the work</strong>
          <p>Put the skills and practice into logical order.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="strategy-row">

        <div class="strategy-number">
          04
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Create evidence</strong>
          <p>Turn learning into projects and demonstrable work.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</header>


<!-- =====================================================
     INTRO
===================================================== -->

<section class="intro">

  <div class="container intro-grid">

    <div>

      <div class="overline">
        The real problem
      </div>

      <h2>
        Finding information isn't the same as knowing what to do.
      </h2>

    </div>

    <div class="intro-copy">

      <p>
        When you decide to learn something new, the internet gives you
        thousands of possible starting points. Courses. Videos. Books.
        Tutorials. Certifications. Communities.
      </p>

      <p>
        The problem becomes deciding what matters, what can wait,
        what belongs together and what you should actually produce
        along the way.
      </p>

      <div class="intro-highlight">
        We don't give you another giant resource list. We build the route.
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =====================================================
     PROBLEM
===================================================== -->

<section class="problem">

  <div class="container">

    <div class="problem-header">

      <div class="overline">
        Why self-directed learning stalls
      </div>

      <h2>
        More information can create more uncertainty.
      </h2>

      <p class="problem-intro">
        Without a structure, even motivated people can spend their
        limited time researching instead of progressing.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="problem-grid">

      <div class="problem-item">

        <div class="problem-number">
          01 / INFORMATION
        </div>

        <h3>
          Too many choices
        </h3>

        <p>
          You find ten resources for the same topic and have no reliable
          way to decide which one belongs in your plan.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="problem-item">

        <div class="problem-number">
          02 / SEQUENCE
        </div>

        <h3>
          No clear order
        </h3>

        <p>
          You can understand individual lessons without knowing what
          knowledge should come before or after them.
        </p>

      </div>


      <div class="problem-item">

        <div class="problem-number">
          03 / EVIDENCE
        </div>

        <h3>
